This adapter uses DiffSynth-Studio's pinned Wan-Dancer low-VRAM inference path.
The Vonk-specific adaptation pins all model paths to the mounted immutable
Wan-AI snapshot, disables runtime downloads and sequence parallelism, runs the
global and local stages as separate processes, preserves the official native
short-clip keyframe mapping, validates the job contract, and publishes the
final MP4 artifact. Wan-Dancer model attribution remains Wan-AI and Wan-Video.
